MEMORANDUM
From: Saruman of Many Colours, Orthanc
To: All staff, Isengard
Re: Restructuring

As many of you have noticed, we are pivoting from wisdom to industry.

Effective immediately:
  - The gardens are now furnaces.
  - The orchard is now a furnace.
  - The furnaces are now bigger furnaces.

Please direct questions about the trees to the suggestion box, which is
also a furnace.

ADDENDUM (week 6)

Some staff have raised concerns about "the forest walking towards us".
This is not in the plan. The plan does not include walking forests.
Please keep working.

ADDENDUM 2 (week 6, later)

Please evacuate to the upper floors. Bring towels.
